WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.400
The sixth day is over, you have now four more left to work and work very

00:11.400 --> 00:22.640
seriously, very diligently, very patiently and persistently to get best

00:22.640 --> 00:33.200
results of your stay here. Sixth day is a very important day. I am glad you

00:33.200 --> 00:42.520
have crossed this hurdle, sixth day. As I said, the second day and the sixth day, it

00:42.520 --> 00:49.400
is difficult for a weak-minded person to cross the hurdle. On the first day, even

00:49.400 --> 00:56.240
when you start on upon, operation starts and with this operation, the second day

00:56.240 --> 01:02.400
one feels like running away. Then again after Vipassana, the fifth day, sixth day,

01:02.400 --> 01:09.440
operation goes deeper and one feels like running away under some pretext or the

01:09.440 --> 01:19.080
other. One pretext. On the fifth day evening, the discourse says so much about

01:19.080 --> 01:24.880
Dukkha, misery, misery. The birth starts with misery and then the whole life

01:24.880 --> 01:31.640
misery, misery of disease, misery of old age, misery of dying, misery of things

01:31.640 --> 01:35.200
happening which you don't like, misery of things not happening that you like,

01:35.200 --> 01:44.760
misery, misery, life after life misery. Oh, this path is path of misery. One doesn't

01:44.760 --> 01:52.000
want to understand. This is a very pessimistic teaching. No, I must run.

01:52.000 --> 01:58.880
Doesn't try to understand or finds an excuse to run away. There is no pessimism,

01:58.880 --> 02:05.840
not a trace of pessimism in the teaching. If the teaching said that you have to

02:05.840 --> 02:10.560
suffer, there is misery, there is no way out, then yes, pessimism. But the teaching

02:10.560 --> 02:16.280
says there's a way out. You can come out of all your miseries and you can reach

02:16.280 --> 02:22.120
the stage where you are totally free from misery. Enjoy real peace, real harmony,

02:22.120 --> 02:33.040
full of optimism, full of optimism. Back home in India there is a story, story in

02:33.040 --> 02:44.160
our country. A mother sends the young son to the grocery shop nearby, gives one

02:44.160 --> 02:51.760
empty bottle, one ten rupee currency note, go, go and buy some cooking oil. The boy

02:51.760 --> 02:59.240
goes, goes, purchases oil, the oil bottle is filled with oil. On his way back, out

02:59.240 --> 03:07.600
of carelessness, he gets knocked down. The bottle falls. Half of the oil flows

03:07.600 --> 03:14.960
out. He picks up the bottle, half empty. Crying, crying, he comes to the mother,

03:14.960 --> 03:22.520
oh mother, I lost half the oil. I lost half the oil. Very pessimistic, very

03:22.520 --> 03:30.120
pessimistic. Story is story. Mother sends another son, another ten rupee note,

03:30.120 --> 03:36.560
another bottle. He also buys oil, gets the bottle filled and story is story.

03:36.560 --> 03:44.520
He also falls down. The bottle falls down. Half the oil has flowed out. This

03:44.520 --> 03:49.400
boy picks up the bottle, very happy, smiling and goes to the mother, look I

03:49.400 --> 03:54.920
saved half the oil. I saved half the oil. I fell down, the bottle fell down, the

03:54.920 --> 03:58.920
bottle would have broken, all the oil would have gone away. Look, half the oil is

03:58.920 --> 04:04.320
saved. Both have reached in the same situation, half bottle full, half empty.

04:04.320 --> 04:09.160
One is crying for the empty one, very pessimistic. Other is happy with the

04:09.160 --> 04:16.920
filled one, at least half is full. Very happy, optimistic. Story is story.

04:16.920 --> 04:23.680
Mother sends the third son. And story is story. He also falls down. Half the bottle

04:23.680 --> 04:28.080
is oil is out. He picks up the bottle like the second boy. He comes smiling. I

04:28.080 --> 04:35.640
saved half the bottle. I saved half oil. But this boy is a Vipassana boy. Not only

04:35.640 --> 04:42.120
optimistic, he is realistic also. I have lost half the oil. This is truth. My bottle

04:42.120 --> 04:48.640
is half empty. And not only realistic, he is a workist like Vipassana. Now I must

04:48.640 --> 04:54.600
work. He says I go out and work hard and by this evening I will earn five rupees

04:54.600 --> 05:02.720
and get this bottle filled. Dhamma is not merely optimism, it is also realism, it is

05:02.720 --> 05:09.120
also workism. So each individual has to work. Always remaining optimistic. Now

05:09.120 --> 05:15.880
pessimism, not a trace of pessimism in Dhamma, all optimism, optimism. You got a

05:15.880 --> 05:21.800
path now to come out of misery. Misery is there. You have to accept it. Half bottle is

05:21.800 --> 05:27.480
empty. You have to accept it. How to fill it? The misery is there. Accept that misery.

05:27.480 --> 05:32.800
And the way is there to come out of misery. Make use of that. This is what you

05:32.800 --> 05:39.880
started doing. You are realizing the truth. It is not merely intellectual

05:39.880 --> 05:45.000
exercise. Not an emotional or devotional acceptance of the truth of misery and

05:45.000 --> 05:50.160
the way out of misery. You are experiencing. When you are working with

05:50.160 --> 05:57.720
the sensation, you are living. Living wisdom is there. The truth is there which

05:57.720 --> 06:04.480
you are experiencing. It is not the wisdom of somebody else. Not a borrowed

06:04.480 --> 06:10.040
wisdom. Your own wisdom with direct experience. The whole process of

06:10.040 --> 06:18.000
observing the sensation makes you understand. Because you started giving

06:18.000 --> 06:21.840
importance to the truth within the framework of the body and the truth at

06:22.320 --> 06:28.720
the experiential level. Otherwise whole life all importance was given to object

06:28.720 --> 06:38.120
outside, object outside. You are craving. Even though you know you are craving. But

06:38.120 --> 06:42.800
you are craving for object outside. And that object has become so predominant

06:42.800 --> 06:47.360
for you. It keeps on overpowering you. You forget that you are craving. And you

06:47.360 --> 06:51.320
also forget that by craving you have lost the balance of your life of your

06:51.320 --> 06:59.440
mind. And you become very miserable. And you also don't understand that you have

06:59.440 --> 07:06.120
become an addict to this craving. A natural requirement. You are thirsty. You

07:06.120 --> 07:12.280
want water. Nothing wrong. You work hard to get water when you are thirsty. You

07:12.280 --> 07:16.840
tried. You didn't get water. You smiled. All right. I try again. You didn't get. I

07:16.840 --> 07:21.800
try again. You don't lose the balance of your mind. But when you start craving

07:21.800 --> 07:27.200
water. Oh still not water. What will happen to me? I may die. Water. Water. You lost

07:27.200 --> 07:32.720
the balance of your mind. You become so miserable. One is not observing all that

07:32.720 --> 07:40.720
inside. Water is not that important. You are craving. Even craving is not that

07:40.720 --> 07:45.400
important. Craving brings misery. The moment you start craving something that

07:45.400 --> 07:53.800
means you are wanting something which is not there. You are not contented. You are

07:53.800 --> 07:59.520
not satisfied with whatever is. You want something which is not. Which is not is

07:59.520 --> 08:04.120
which is not. And you become very miserable because of that. You keep on

08:04.120 --> 08:09.320
realizing this. Look I am becoming miserable. I am becoming miserable. Then

08:09.320 --> 08:14.520
there is a way to come out of it. You don't know anything. You just go get

08:14.520 --> 08:19.320
overpowered by this misery of craving. And then you don't know how you become

08:19.320 --> 08:27.560
addicted to this craving. This becomes worse. One becomes addicted to craving.

08:27.560 --> 08:34.320
When you start observing sensations a stage will come sooner. Maybe later in

08:34.320 --> 08:41.400
some cases. When you start understanding that you are actually not craving for

08:41.400 --> 08:48.040
this object or that object. You are craving for a particular sensation. When

08:48.040 --> 08:54.320
you crave, crave for anything, a sensation arises. And when that craving is

08:54.320 --> 08:58.880
fulfilled there is no more sensation. And you want that sensation again. So you have

08:58.880 --> 09:03.480
to crave for something else. Once your craving is fulfilled, the object is

09:03.480 --> 09:10.320
attained. It becomes still and you want something else. That is attained. Again

09:10.320 --> 09:15.000
it becomes still. You want something else. You have become addicted to this craving.

09:15.000 --> 09:22.120
Say somebody is living in a one-bedroom cottage. Quite happy. Suddenly it comes to

09:22.120 --> 09:26.480
his mind. What one bedroom cottage? I must have at least a big house with three

09:26.480 --> 09:32.880
bedrooms. Alright. Had a house with three bedrooms. Then it must be well furnished.

09:32.880 --> 09:38.600
This furniture, that furniture. Well furnished. Alright. Well furnished. Then

09:38.600 --> 09:43.520
that becomes still. Then I must have this apparatus, that apparatus. A TV and a

09:43.520 --> 09:49.920
color TV and VCR and a definite deck or washing machine or cleaning

09:49.920 --> 09:54.400
machine or this machine or that machine. The entire house is full of all these

09:54.400 --> 10:01.360
things. No space even to breathe. And yet no satisfaction. Craving, craving. My car.

10:01.360 --> 10:08.240
Oh this ordinary car, a tin pot. I must have that model. How about having a

10:08.240 --> 10:16.520
Toyota? And then Toyota comes on. No, no. I must have BWM. And then no, no. I must

10:16.520 --> 10:22.560
have Mercedes Benz. Oh no. I must have Rolls Royce. Oh no. And then not Rolls Royce

10:22.560 --> 10:27.920
of this model or that model. Then latest model, latest model. Not just one, two. A

10:27.920 --> 10:35.840
fleet of Rolls Royce. Still not contented. I must have my own helicopter.

10:35.840 --> 10:41.040
People have their helicopters. I must have helicopter. Alright. Helicopter has

10:41.040 --> 10:46.960
come. Then I must have my aeroplane. My own aeroplane. Aeroplane has come. Now I

10:46.960 --> 10:54.040
want a spacecraft. I must go to the moon. A spacecraft to take me to the moon. Oh

10:54.040 --> 10:59.600
that also is still. I must have a spacecraft to go to the Mars. To this

10:59.600 --> 11:05.400
planet. To that planet. Not that. To this galaxy. That galaxy. Oh sky is the limit.

11:05.400 --> 11:12.680
Even sky is not the limit. No limit. It is a bottomless bucket. You can't fill it.

11:12.680 --> 11:19.120
Because you started getting addicted to craving. You are not craving for an

11:19.120 --> 11:25.200
object. You are craving for the sake of craving. That makes the situation worse

11:25.200 --> 11:33.320
and this is what happens. As you proceed on the path it will become so clear. When

11:33.320 --> 11:38.360
we say somebody is addicted to alcohol or somebody is addicted to drugs. No. It's

11:38.360 --> 11:44.480
wrong. At the surface level, apparent level, it seems to be so. Actually one is

11:44.480 --> 11:50.000
addicted to the sensation. By taking alcohol one feels a kind of sensation and

11:50.000 --> 11:53.920
one wants that sensation again and again. So one has to take alcohol again and

11:53.920 --> 12:01.000
again. One has to take drug again and again. The sensation is so important.

12:01.000 --> 12:08.200
This was the discovery of Buddha. Unless you start learning how to observe your

12:08.200 --> 12:13.400
sensation you cannot come out of any addiction. Addiction of alcohol, addiction

12:13.400 --> 12:18.800
of drug is nothing compared to your addiction of craving. Compared to your

12:18.800 --> 12:24.560
addiction of aversion. So many impurities of the mind. You are addicted to all

12:24.560 --> 12:28.160
those impurities and you keep on repeating them, repeating them, repeating

12:28.160 --> 12:32.160
them because you are addicted to a particular type of sensation. You want

12:32.160 --> 12:35.920
the sensation again and again. You generate certain impurities to get that

12:35.920 --> 12:39.320
sensation. When that is over again you generate the same sensation by

12:39.320 --> 12:44.240
generating this kind of negativity. This has become the habit pattern of the mind.

12:44.240 --> 12:50.440
How to come out of it? Misery is there. But a way to come out of misery is also

12:50.440 --> 12:58.480
there. Observe. Learn how to observe. Whatever is happening you are silent

12:58.480 --> 13:04.320
witness. Don't react like somebody sitting at the bank of the river. The

13:04.320 --> 13:08.640
flow of the river is there. You do nothing for the flow of the river. It's

13:08.640 --> 13:14.560
natural. Sitting at the bank you just observe. This is more than that. A flow

13:14.560 --> 13:21.040
of vibration, sensation throughout the body. You are feeling it. Like a research

13:21.040 --> 13:29.680
scientist in his lab. In a glass tube some chemical is there. He heats up, heats

13:29.680 --> 13:35.280
up some liquid chemical and that gets evaporated. Volatile matter gets

13:35.280 --> 13:41.720
evaporated and that moves in some other tube, gets condensed, comes out as liquid.

13:41.720 --> 13:47.800
He's just observing. Just observing. When it gets evaporated it doesn't start

13:47.800 --> 13:52.680
crying, oh where my chemical went away. When comes back again as a liquid form

13:52.680 --> 13:57.680
it will start dancing. He just understands. But all that understanding

13:57.680 --> 14:02.000
of a scientist is only at the intellectual level. He's not experiencing.

14:02.000 --> 14:08.240
Here you are experiencing the entire physical structure. What is this? How it

14:08.280 --> 14:14.400
is working. The mental structure. The combination of the two. The interaction

14:14.400 --> 14:19.640
of the two. How one is influencing the other. How one gets influenced by the

14:19.640 --> 14:25.200
other. How the mind gets originated because of matter. How the matter gets

14:25.200 --> 14:29.760
originated because of the mind. At times it looks as if matter is changing into

14:29.760 --> 14:35.080
mind. At times it looks as if the mind is changing into matter. All that one is

14:35.080 --> 14:40.480
experiencing and that makes so much difference. Then the wisdom that you get

14:40.480 --> 14:45.880
by this experience is your own wisdom. Not because Buddha said so. Not because

14:45.880 --> 14:52.240
your teacher says so. Not because any scripture says so. The material

14:52.240 --> 14:59.160
structure made of subatomic particles, tiny little kalapas. The entire universe

14:59.160 --> 15:11.440
made of tiny little kalapas. Four basic elements. Earth, water, fire, air and four

15:11.440 --> 15:17.200
characteristic each of them. The entire universe is like that. Entire material

15:17.200 --> 15:27.000
universe is like that. You see things solid. Earth element, liquid, water element.

15:27.000 --> 15:34.600
Air, gaseous, air element and the temperature prevailing everywhere. Fire

15:34.600 --> 15:43.880
element. The snow solid turns into water, gets evaporated as gas and there is

15:43.880 --> 15:50.240
temperature in all the three cases. Similarly in our body also. Bones etc. so

15:50.240 --> 15:58.280
solid. Earth element. Blood etc. water element. Gases etc. air element and the

15:58.280 --> 16:05.360
temperature prevailing. Fire element. But that is not the deeper

16:05.360 --> 16:12.640
level of the reality. The characteristic of each element which you experience at

16:12.640 --> 16:18.960
the sensation level, this is more important. When you talk of earth element

16:18.960 --> 16:26.200
not that you look for a particle of dust in this element. Nothing doing. Water

16:26.200 --> 16:31.440
element. You don't look for a drop of water in it. Nothing doing. What is the

16:31.440 --> 16:37.400
sensation that you feel because of that? Earth element. The entire field of

16:37.400 --> 16:45.960
weight from the heaviest sensation feeling to the lightest is the

16:45.960 --> 16:58.600
characteristic of the earth element. Like pulverized cement dust. Light. It

16:58.600 --> 17:04.280
becomes solidified. Becomes heavy. When it is solidified it's rough. When it is

17:04.280 --> 17:10.200
pulverized it is fine. Soft. You get sensations like that. Heavy, solidified

17:10.200 --> 17:15.320
sensation of one type. Very rough. That gets dissolved and then you have soft.

17:15.320 --> 17:24.160
Same earth element but very soft. All the field of weight is the characteristic of

17:24.160 --> 17:30.400
the earth element. Similarly the entire field of movement from the little

17:30.400 --> 17:39.240
little movement to very big movement is the element of air. The entire field of

17:39.240 --> 17:45.960
temperature from the coldest to the hottest is the field of fire element.

17:45.960 --> 17:56.240
And the water element. Binding nature. Cohesiveness. The entire structure is

17:56.240 --> 18:02.240
within your boundary. It's bound up. This is water element. This is what you

18:02.240 --> 18:07.520
experience. All the sensations that you have been experiencing till now and the

18:07.520 --> 18:11.360
all the experiences that you will experience in future you have only these

18:11.360 --> 18:15.280
four elements manifesting with this sensation or that sensation. At times

18:15.280 --> 18:20.200
masses of subatomic particles will arise with the predominance of earth element

18:20.200 --> 18:24.080
or with the predominance of water element or with the predominance of air

18:24.080 --> 18:28.280
element or with the predominance of fire element. That's all. These four elements

18:28.280 --> 18:39.560
are there. A good meditator will not get affected. Oh now masses of kalapas have

18:39.560 --> 18:44.800
arisen with earth element. Predominance of earth element. Let me see how long

18:44.800 --> 18:49.960
they last. Fire element. Let me see how long they last. Water element. Let me see

18:49.960 --> 18:54.200
how long they last. Air element. Let me see how long they last. It does not react.

18:54.200 --> 18:59.360
One just observes. And these sensations which are manifestation of different

18:59.360 --> 19:05.120
elements they arise. Sooner or later they pass away. They arise. Sooner or later they

19:05.120 --> 19:11.200
pass away. It becomes clearer. Clearer. Like a scientist you are exploring the

19:11.200 --> 19:16.280
truth the nature of these kalapas and you are also exploring the truth of

19:16.280 --> 19:22.040
your mind. How the mind gets influenced. How you understand how these kalapas

19:22.040 --> 19:27.520
get originated. How they multiply. How the mind gets influenced by them and how

19:27.520 --> 19:32.480
you react and the reaction gets multiplied. All that phenomena becomes so

19:32.480 --> 19:42.200
clear. So clear. These kalapas, subatomic particles, how they arise, how they get

19:42.200 --> 19:52.480
originated. Four kinds of food you give to them. Two material food and two mental

19:52.480 --> 19:58.840
food. Material input and mental input are responsible for the generation of

19:58.840 --> 20:03.720
different types of kalapas in your body. And that you will start experiencing as

20:03.720 --> 20:09.880
you proceed on the path it will become clearer and clearer. The material food.

20:09.880 --> 20:14.920
The food that you take once, twice or three times during the day. What type of

20:14.920 --> 20:20.800
material food you have taken. That type of kalapas will start arising with the

20:20.800 --> 20:25.600
predominance of this element or that element. For example as you proceed on

20:25.600 --> 20:29.320
the path and you become more and more sensitive to your sensations it will

20:29.320 --> 20:35.880
become very clear. Say one day you have taken real hot food. Indian hot food. Lot

20:35.880 --> 20:40.240
of chilies. And then you sit for meditation after some time. And you get a

20:40.240 --> 20:44.720
burning sensation here and a burning sensation here. The fire element. You are

20:44.720 --> 20:48.600
given that input and the fire element. The atoms are arising with the

20:48.600 --> 20:55.520
predominance of fire element. You have taken very stale food or very greasy food and

20:55.520 --> 21:00.800
you sit for meditation. Earth element. You feel so heavy. So heavy here. So what type

21:00.800 --> 21:04.600
of food you are taking. You take healthy food your body becomes healthy. You take

21:04.600 --> 21:10.640
unhealthy food your body becomes unhealthy. Law of nature. Second input. The

21:10.640 --> 21:16.920
material input of the atmosphere around you. Every moment the body keeps on

21:16.920 --> 21:23.520
sucking the material atmosphere around. One lives in a cold country, cold climate.

21:23.520 --> 21:29.080
One type of body lives in hot country, hot climate. Another type of body. This

21:29.080 --> 21:34.440
kind of kalapas get generated because of the atmosphere around. Two other inputs.

21:34.440 --> 21:42.920
Mental inputs. The present mind at this moment my mind is generating this

21:42.920 --> 21:49.040
particular sankhara. This sankhara, this type with this sankhara, this mind with

21:49.040 --> 21:54.640
this sankhara will start generating these atomic kalapas particles with

21:54.640 --> 22:02.440
particular type of element. Like at this moment I generate anger. I have generated

22:02.600 --> 22:06.400
anger at the mental level but the kalapas that have started generating are

22:06.400 --> 22:13.200
kalapas with the predominance of fire burning, burning, burning. Or I generate a

22:13.200 --> 22:19.800
fear, fear sankhara and then trembling, trembling, air element, air element. What

22:19.800 --> 22:26.280
type of input I am giving at the mental level at this moment. How the mind turns

22:26.280 --> 22:31.160
into matter or influences the matter or makes the matter to originate in a

22:31.160 --> 22:39.720
particular way. And then the fourth input is your old sankharas. The reality

22:39.720 --> 22:46.120
of the mind is every moment it is influenced by the sankhara. The present

22:46.120 --> 22:50.440
sankhara either you keep on generating sankhara from moment to moment. You stop

22:50.440 --> 22:54.120
generating sankhara as you practice in vipassana. You don't generate any sankhara

22:54.120 --> 23:00.160
at this moment. Then your old stop will start coming up on the surface. This is

23:00.160 --> 23:06.520
the fruit of your old sankhara. In your daily life also as you get established

23:06.520 --> 23:12.360
in the technique it will be very clear. You get something unpleasant happens in

23:12.360 --> 23:17.040
your life. Before that something unpleasant happens in the life outside

23:17.040 --> 23:21.840
very unpleasant sensation has started in you. And then only something

23:21.840 --> 23:24.960
unpleasant happens in the life. Something very pleasant happens in the

23:24.960 --> 23:29.360
life a pleasant sensation has started in you. So the fruit first comes as a

23:29.360 --> 23:37.240
sensation. The seed was planted as a sensation. Say a seed of anger. My

23:37.240 --> 23:43.840
sankhara of anger as I plant the seed of anger I feel so much heat. Fruit of this

23:43.840 --> 23:47.720
particular sankhara when it comes up it will come up with the same kind of

23:47.720 --> 23:53.920
sensation again heat very much heat. So the sankhara that I am generating now is

23:54.560 --> 24:01.160
one input and it creates fire element in the body. And the sankhara of the past if

24:01.160 --> 24:05.520
it is a sankhara of anger the fruit of that will again have fire element. Like

24:05.520 --> 24:10.120
this the sankhara now or the sankhara past are another two reasons for

24:10.120 --> 24:14.480
different kind of kalapas to arise different kind of kalapas to arise. As

24:14.480 --> 24:21.320
you keep on observing then you understand that more and more I react to

24:21.320 --> 24:25.840
these sensations more and more I generate new sankharas and I create more

24:25.840 --> 24:31.640
and more misery for me. And if I stop generating new sankharas then the old

24:31.640 --> 24:37.480
ones come on the surface they create a sensation and again I smile at the

24:37.480 --> 24:42.160
sensation. This is also impermanent. Let me see how long it lasts. Let me see how

24:42.160 --> 24:47.280
long it lasts. It passes away. That means layers of that particular old sankhara

24:47.280 --> 24:51.040
has come on the surface and passed away. Chunks after chunks will come on the

24:51.040 --> 24:55.800
surface and pass away. You are relieved from that. You are not generating a new

24:55.800 --> 25:00.720
sankhara. You are getting liberated from your old stock of the sankharas and the

25:00.720 --> 25:06.000
process is such it will take take you to the stage. Everyone who keeps on working

25:06.000 --> 25:11.200
working properly of course it takes time. Not that one becomes perfect by taking a

25:11.200 --> 25:14.680
10-day course but by 10-day course one understand this is how I have to work

25:14.680 --> 25:18.800
and one keeps on working keeps on working ultimately one reaches the stage

25:18.800 --> 25:22.880
where there is no more past sankharas left and you don't generate a new

25:22.880 --> 25:29.560
sankhara and this is what is called Kheenam Puranam Navam Natya Sambhavam

25:29.560 --> 25:35.760
Kheenam Puranam. All the old stock is eradicated now and no new sankhara can

25:35.760 --> 25:40.800
be generated. One is a liberated person and this happens by one's own practice.

25:40.800 --> 25:46.480
No one else can do that for you. The sankharas that is accumulated is

25:46.480 --> 25:50.360
accumulation of your own. You have accumulated them. You are responsible for

25:50.360 --> 25:54.920
that. Your ignorance is responsible for that. Slowly you are coming out of that

25:54.920 --> 25:59.720
ignorance. You are developing your wisdom, living wisdom, wisdom at the

25:59.720 --> 26:04.400
experiential level and you see how the old stock is getting eradicated,

26:04.400 --> 26:10.440
eradicated. You are coming nearer and nearer to the final goal. Each individual

26:10.440 --> 26:15.920
has to work. No one else can do anything for you. Can only just show the path.

26:16.840 --> 26:24.520
Hindrances are there. Difficulties are there. In the language of those days it

26:24.520 --> 26:30.400
is called Nivarana, like curtain, thick curtains which won't allow you to see

26:30.400 --> 26:35.920
the things behind the curtain. You can't see the reality within you because

26:35.920 --> 26:42.160
of these Nivaranas, these obstacles, these barriers. Five big Nivaranas, five

26:42.160 --> 26:48.200
big barriers. I call them five big enemies of every meditation, Vipassana

26:48.200 --> 26:57.520
meditator. Five big enemies. Two big enemies, craving and aversion. You are

26:57.520 --> 27:02.600
meditating to come out of your old habit of craving, to come out of your old habit

27:02.600 --> 27:08.480
of aversion. And ignorantly you are meditating. You are meditating and

27:08.480 --> 27:12.200
multiplying your craving. You are meditating and multiplying your aversion.

27:12.200 --> 27:15.760
You are supposed to come out of craving. You are supposed to come out of

27:15.760 --> 27:19.480
misery, of craving. You are supposed to come out of the misery of aversion and

27:19.480 --> 27:23.960
look what you started doing. This is because of the old habit pattern of the

27:23.960 --> 27:28.480
mind, because of the ignorance, because of these Nivaranas, these two Nivaranas,

27:28.480 --> 27:36.240
two barriers. An example how it happens. In a course like this there are many

27:36.240 --> 27:40.720
reasons for asking the students, no communication, don't talk with the fellow

27:40.720 --> 27:45.000
student. If any problem come and discuss with the assistant teacher or the

27:45.000 --> 27:51.440
teacher. But keep on working your own. Keep on working your own. But human mind

27:51.440 --> 27:57.200
is human mind. Always inquisitive about others. You get one opportunity and you

27:57.200 --> 28:02.480
start talking, hey how about you? How about you? And this person replies, I get a

28:02.480 --> 28:07.200
flow of tingling vibrations. Tingling throughout the body? And I didn't get any

28:07.200 --> 28:12.080
tingling? And somebody says I got a flow of like electric current throughout the

28:12.080 --> 28:16.560
body. Electric current? Wonderful. I didn't get. And when you sit for meditation now,

28:16.560 --> 28:21.560
I want tingling sensation. I want electric current or no electric current

28:21.560 --> 28:29.160
for me. No tingling sensation for me. And you keep craving, craving, craving. You were

28:29.160 --> 28:33.120
here to come out of craving. And in the name of meditation, in the name of

28:33.120 --> 28:39.880
Ippassana, I started craving, craving. Craving is craving. Misery. Even if you

28:39.880 --> 28:44.920
crave for the final goal, liberation, Nirvana. I want Nibbana, I want Nibbana.

28:44.920 --> 28:50.120
You are running in the opposite direction of Nibbana. Nibbana is a stage

28:50.120 --> 28:53.920
free from craving. And you are multiplying your craving. How can you

28:53.920 --> 28:59.440
reach the stage of free from craving by generating craving? Not possible. So

28:59.440 --> 29:03.080
whenever you find this enemy is overpowering you, come out of it as

29:03.080 --> 29:08.080
quickly as possible. Don't allow it. Whatever comes about this moment, this

29:08.080 --> 29:12.600
sensation or that sensation, even no sensation, doesn't matter. You accept the

29:12.600 --> 29:21.080
reality of this moment as it is, as it is. What is not there, you want that. Then

29:21.120 --> 29:25.120
again, the same old habit pattern, what is not there, you want that. And that

29:25.120 --> 29:30.040
becomes craving. And you start having attachment to this craving. It becomes a

29:30.040 --> 29:37.080
big misery for you. Similarly, aversion. An example, you are made to sit for one

29:37.080 --> 29:43.520
hour, Adikthana. You can't open your eyes, can't open your legs, you can't open

29:43.520 --> 29:50.960
your hands. You somehow manage half an hour. You manage 45 minutes. After that,

29:50.960 --> 29:57.240
then the torture starts. Then again, the same human mind inquisitiveness about

29:57.240 --> 30:01.720
others. You are not supposed to open your eyes. And still you open a little bit of

30:01.720 --> 30:06.800
eye. What is happening to others? Is this pain, I am only suffering with pain or

30:06.800 --> 30:13.280
everybody is suffering with pain? You are so curious about others. And you notice at that

30:13.280 --> 30:17.480
time everybody is sitting like a statue of Buddha. That means they have got no pain.

30:17.480 --> 30:24.160
Only I have got pain. My pain has not gone away. Everybody's pain has gone away. Oh this

30:24.160 --> 30:29.640
pain. Then your aversion becomes multiply. Aversion towards this pain. My teacher

30:29.640 --> 30:34.160
keeps on saying everything is anicca, anicca, impermanent, impermanent. Maybe

30:34.160 --> 30:40.680
true. But this pain is permanent. This is not impermanent. Look, how many times I

30:40.680 --> 30:46.560
told you, you are anicca, you are anicca. And still it is not going. This is

30:46.560 --> 30:53.520
permanent. This is permanent. Aversion, aversion, aversion. The enemy has overpowered

30:53.520 --> 30:57.680
you. You are multiplying aversion. You are here to come out of aversion and you

30:57.680 --> 31:04.160
started multiplying the aversion. Another two big enemies. Understand all these

31:04.160 --> 31:11.040
enemies, they are defilements, mental defilements, which came in your body, in

31:11.040 --> 31:17.520
your mind as guests and then they became owner of the house. They don't want to go

31:17.520 --> 31:22.560
out. And when you practice vipashyana they can't stay, they have to go out. Like

31:22.560 --> 31:26.600
a switch on light comes on the darkness has to go. You won't have to tell darkness

31:26.600 --> 31:30.120
who you go away now. Now there is light. When you practice vipashyana these

31:30.120 --> 31:34.840
defilements have to go and they don't want to go. So they give a kick from

31:34.840 --> 31:40.200
within. Stop vipashyana. This is not good for me. I don't want to go. You stop vipashyana.

31:40.200 --> 31:46.080
Two kinds of kicks are given from within. One big kick is that it will make you

31:46.080 --> 31:51.280
so drowsy. You have a sound sleep all right. You sit for meditation you feel so

31:51.280 --> 31:57.480
drowsy, so drowsy. A very big enemy is overpowering you. Fight it out. Have

31:57.480 --> 32:01.200
heart breathing. If that doesn't work and if it is not that one hour sitting,

32:01.200 --> 32:06.240
stand up and meditate with heart breathing. That doesn't work. Get out, walk

32:06.240 --> 32:10.280
five minutes or ten minutes, observe your sensation or respiration, come and

32:10.280 --> 32:15.160
sit. Keep on fighting this enemy. Otherwise this enemy overpowers you. You

32:15.160 --> 32:22.080
can't meditate. Another kick from within. Either this kick will make you very much

32:22.080 --> 32:26.840
drowsy or it will make you very much agitated. You feel like doing little bit

32:26.840 --> 32:31.080
of this, feel like doing little bit of this, little bit of this, little bit of

32:31.080 --> 32:37.240
this, but no meditation. You are in one hour sitting Adikthana and a kick from

32:37.240 --> 32:41.820
within. You have taken whole of your body outside and then you realize oh I was in

32:41.820 --> 32:45.560
Adikthana. How I came here? A kick from within won't allow you to practice

32:45.560 --> 32:54.520
properly. This enemy, dangerous enemy. Another enemy, fifth enemy. Doubt, doubt.

32:54.520 --> 33:00.240
All kinds of doubt come in the mind. What is this technique? What sort of

33:00.240 --> 33:04.320
technique is this? Observe respiration, observe respiration. Even when I was not

33:04.320 --> 33:08.160
observing respiration, it was there all the time. What I gained by observing

33:08.160 --> 33:11.520
respiration? Now observing the heat, observing the perspiration. What I'm

33:11.520 --> 33:17.760
doing? Have I gone crazy? What kind of meditation? And this doubt will not

33:17.760 --> 33:23.640
allow you to work. Another doubt at times, another doubt comes about your teacher.

33:23.640 --> 33:31.360
What teacher? I was expecting a great guru from India with capital G. What kind

33:31.360 --> 33:37.040
of guru? He doesn't have matted long hair, does not have big mustache or

33:37.040 --> 33:42.880
beards, even no shaven head and he has got no bunches of rosaries around his

33:42.880 --> 33:48.000
neck, no trademark on his forehead, no paraphernalia of a teacher, no guru. What

33:48.000 --> 34:04.880
kind of guru? He doesn't look like freak. He looks like a straight. What guru? No. And he's got no

34:04.880 --> 34:10.640
supernatural power. He can't fly in the air. He can't dig dips in the earth. He and his

34:10.640 --> 34:14.760
assistant keep on asking, how about you? They should know what, how about you? Why

34:14.760 --> 34:23.360
they ask a student? No supernatural power. Doubt. Doubt and you can't work. Third

34:23.360 --> 34:28.080
kind of doubts come. Yes, the technique is good because so many people keep

34:28.080 --> 34:32.200
coming and they get benefit. They keep coming repeatedly. Certainly it is good.

34:32.200 --> 34:35.920
Teacher is also good because so many people listen to him. So perhaps good.

34:35.920 --> 34:42.080
Alright. I am not good. I am not fit for this. Doubt about one's own capability. I

34:42.560 --> 34:50.960
am not fit. This is not the time for me. And this scene is not for me. I better

34:50.960 --> 34:57.200
quit. And one feels like running away. Oh this doubt, doubt, doubt. Any of these

34:57.200 --> 35:02.800
three doubts overpowers you and you stop meditating. These five nirvanas, five

35:02.800 --> 35:07.520
enemies, be careful. Don't allow them to overpower you and then you will find

35:07.520 --> 35:12.480
you are progressing, you are progressing, you are progressing.

35:13.480 --> 35:19.520
The technique is wonderful. There is no dogma involved in it. No blind faith

35:19.520 --> 35:25.040
involved in it. No cult involved in it. It's pure science of mind and matter. The

35:25.040 --> 35:30.760
interaction of mind and matter. How out of ignorance this mind keeps on reacting

35:30.760 --> 35:35.360
to these sensations. Keep on generating negativities and because of this

35:35.400 --> 35:39.720
negativity more and more this particular type of sensation arises and when that

35:39.720 --> 35:43.520
sensation rises you more react with negativity and this vicious circle

35:43.520 --> 35:47.520
becomes miserable, more and more miserable. You start observing it. You

35:47.520 --> 35:53.600
start coming out of it. Just universal law of nature. Nothing to do with this

35:53.600 --> 35:58.520
particular organized religion or that organized religion. Truth is truth.

35:58.520 --> 36:04.720
Universal truth. Universal law. Dhamma is universal law. Natural law. And that will

36:04.720 --> 36:10.560
become clearer and clearer if you keep on working. The law of nature is such

36:10.560 --> 36:14.680
that if you keep on reacting with negativity you are multiplying your

36:14.680 --> 36:20.520
misery. You stop this reaction you started coming out of misery and this

36:20.520 --> 36:25.400
has worked even in the past. This works now. This will keep on working in future.

36:25.400 --> 36:30.040
Even in the past whether there was a Buddha or no Buddha. Buddha says whether

36:30.040 --> 36:34.000
I am there or not. Whether somebody becomes an enlightened or not. The law of

36:34.160 --> 36:40.360
nature remains the same. It is eternal. All the time when one generates

36:40.360 --> 36:44.800
negativity one is bound to suffer. All the time one starts coming out of

36:44.800 --> 36:52.120
negativity one starts getting liberated from the misery. A Buddha discovers. This

36:52.120 --> 36:56.440
law remains covered. People do not know what is happening. Deep inside how you

36:56.440 --> 37:01.480
generate negativity people do not know. The enlightened one's enlightenment is

37:01.480 --> 37:06.800
that he goes deep inside and finds out how one keeps on generating negativities

37:06.800 --> 37:11.360
to these sensations and keeps on multiplying one's misery. How observing

37:11.360 --> 37:15.480
the sensation one can come out of this misery. Come out of the negativity. This

37:15.480 --> 37:20.440
is found out by somebody which is there already. The law is there already. And then

37:20.440 --> 37:24.360
out of compassion he starts teaching it to others. Giving this technique to

37:24.360 --> 37:29.080
others. People follow it and they come out of their misery. This happened to

37:29.480 --> 37:34.080
thousands upon thousands of people in the life of the Buddha. And after that

37:34.080 --> 37:39.880
also during these 25 centuries whoever practiced got the same benefit. And even

37:39.880 --> 37:44.240
in future who will be practicing will get the same benefit. Today anybody is

37:44.240 --> 37:48.800
practicing will get the same benefit. The law is law. It is eternal. The same law.

37:48.800 --> 37:58.560
The Dharma is eternal. The same law prevails. At the time of Buddha

37:58.560 --> 38:05.080
how miserable people came out of their misery. Not because of any miracle or

38:05.080 --> 38:11.080
magic of Buddha. The same technique was given. One instance of this person

38:11.080 --> 38:18.520
Angulimal. A young man very angry. He had taken a vow that he will kill

38:18.520 --> 38:26.680
1,000 human beings. How much anger he has got. And he killed 999 of them and he

38:26.680 --> 38:31.920
was looking for the thousandth one. And how to remember how many he has killed.

38:31.920 --> 38:37.560
So whomever he kills he cuts the finger and puts a garland around his neck.

38:37.560 --> 38:42.440
And keeps on counting how many fingers. And that is why he was called Angulimal.

38:42.440 --> 38:48.280
One he is wearing a garland of fingers. When he was looking for the one

38:48.280 --> 38:53.520
thousandth person he came across Buddha. Or rather Buddha out of compassion came

38:53.520 --> 39:00.840
to him. Just to save him from his misery. No magic. No miracle. Same technique was

39:00.840 --> 39:05.480
given to him. And he started realizing that he is a miserable person. Full of

39:05.480 --> 39:10.080
misery. And started working on it. And working, working, working he came out of

39:10.080 --> 39:17.160
misery. Here is the final goal. A full liberated person. An anaharanth. Full of

39:17.160 --> 39:22.640
compassion. Full of love. Full of goodwill for others. And now he goes

39:22.640 --> 39:27.480
around from village to village. From countryside to countryside. From city to

39:27.480 --> 39:33.840
city. Everywhere people are so miserable. I was so ignorant. Out of my ignorance I

39:33.840 --> 39:37.840
had been harming myself. I had been harming others. Like me there are so many

39:37.840 --> 39:41.520
who are harming themselves. They are harming others. If they get this wonderful

39:41.520 --> 39:45.520
technique certainly they will come out of their misery. Certainly they will come

39:45.520 --> 39:50.240
out of their misery. So out of compassion he goes to different places.

39:50.240 --> 39:56.120
He teaches this dhamma, this technique to others. Some people recognize him.

39:56.120 --> 40:01.040
Although he's become a monk now. He's the same Angulimala who has killed my mother

40:01.040 --> 40:05.240
or killed my father or killed my wife or killed my husband or killed my son. Same

40:05.240 --> 40:10.520
Angulimala. And out of anger they throw stones at him. They beat him. Blood starts

40:10.520 --> 40:17.000
flowing from his body. But from the heart only compassion flows. Oh miserable

40:17.000 --> 40:23.320
people. I was also equally miserable. Out of ignorance I was harming myself. I was

40:23.320 --> 40:28.100
harming others. See this technique how it helps you. You will come out of all your

40:28.100 --> 40:33.920
misery. Give it trial. Give it trial. Full of compassion. The whole life full of

40:33.920 --> 40:40.400
compassion. How miserable people came out of their misery so easily. Of course by

40:40.400 --> 40:44.600
practicing the technique understanding that this technique alone can take us

40:44.600 --> 40:48.840
out from the misery. Unless we come out of our negativities, unless we come out

40:48.840 --> 40:55.720
of our sankaras, there is no liberation from misery. A very miserable woman by

40:55.720 --> 41:04.720
the name of Kisa Gautami got married and for number of years had no issue and she

41:04.720 --> 41:11.120
was craving for a child. After a number of years she got a child. Unfortunately

41:11.120 --> 41:16.040
within two years the child died. She had developed so much of attachment to the

41:16.040 --> 41:21.840
child and the child died. This sorrow was unbearable for her. She took the dead

41:21.840 --> 41:26.080
body corpse of the child to the breast and she won't give it to the people to

41:26.080 --> 41:30.720
take to the cremation ground or take to the graveyard. No my child does not die.

41:30.720 --> 41:35.400
It is sleeping. Please do something so that he gets awakened. Please do

41:35.400 --> 41:41.360
something. And people say no mother he has died and no use expecting that he

41:41.360 --> 41:47.440
will wake up. But she has gone totally insane. No I can't give. My son has

41:47.440 --> 41:53.240
not died. Has not died. Please do something. Please do something. One wise

41:53.240 --> 41:58.680
person told her nobody has got any medicine for this dead body. You may go

41:58.680 --> 42:03.000
to Buddha. He has got his meditation center here. You go there. Perhaps he may

42:03.000 --> 42:07.880
do something for you. And she went to Buddha. Placed the dead body before his

42:07.880 --> 42:14.200
feet and crying crying my son has not died. People say he's dead. Even if he's

42:14.200 --> 42:19.080
dead please do something. Please do something. Buddha found that her mind

42:19.080 --> 42:23.800
was so emotionally unbalanced any kind of dhamma teaching will not work there.

42:23.800 --> 42:31.120
He had his own way of teaching. Asked her all right. Go to the city. Get a few grains

42:31.240 --> 42:38.140
of sesame. Very happy. Buddha is going to do something for my son. Buddha said

42:38.140 --> 42:43.600
wait. Listen the instruction properly. You must bring these seeds of sesame from

42:43.600 --> 42:48.520
some house where nobody has died. From a family where nobody has died. Yes, yes

42:48.520 --> 42:55.880
sir. I'll bring that. And she went out. From house to house. From street to street.

42:55.920 --> 43:01.440
Every house she's asking for sesame seed. My son has died and Buddha is going to

43:01.440 --> 43:06.360
do something. Please get give me. Oh you may take bag full of seed. May your son

43:06.360 --> 43:11.640
get alive. And then she questions has anybody died in your family. And with a

43:11.640 --> 43:15.480
long face she says yes my father has died or my mother has died or my brother has

43:15.480 --> 43:20.240
died or so and so has died. And the next house and the next house. Not a single

43:20.240 --> 43:26.200
house she got where somebody has not died. And by the time the whole day she

43:26.200 --> 43:31.120
came to senses. There is no house. There is no family where somebody does not die.

43:31.120 --> 43:36.400
This is law of nature. People take birth to die sooner or later. And now her mind

43:36.400 --> 43:42.040
was in a position to learn dhamma. She came back and Buddha gave dhamma. The

43:42.040 --> 43:46.920
same dhamma. Observe respiration. Observe sensation. Go deeper, deeper, deeper. And

43:46.920 --> 43:52.420
you find all your misery will get evaporated layers after layers. And this

43:52.420 --> 43:59.160
Kisa Gautami became an arhan. Fully liberated. And all her life serving

43:59.160 --> 44:05.240
people like me. So many mothers. Like me so many sisters. Oh they are so miserable.

44:05.240 --> 44:09.520
If they get this wonderful dhamma they will come out of their misery. Out of

44:09.520 --> 44:13.480
this compassion kept on serving people in dhamma. Kept on serving people in

44:13.480 --> 44:20.000
dhamma. Another miserable person like this. Daughter of a very rich person

44:20.000 --> 44:28.000
Patachara. She also lost her husband. She had two sons. Lost both the sons. Lost her

44:28.000 --> 44:33.280
brother, mother, father. Now nobody was there in the wide world. And she became

44:33.280 --> 44:39.960
insane. Total insane. Running in the streets of Savati. Totally naked. And

44:40.440 --> 44:44.280
people throwing stones at her. And she won't understand what is happening.

44:44.280 --> 44:50.440
Because of some past parmi, some good karmas of the past. She came in contact

44:50.440 --> 44:56.880
with Buddha. Buddha was teaching dhamma to others. And she passed by. And Buddha

44:56.880 --> 45:03.440
said come my child. And she came there. And as she sat down she got senses even

45:03.440 --> 45:08.720
for a few minutes. And she found that she is naked. Somebody threw a cloth over her.

45:08.720 --> 45:15.240
And from then onwards she was called Patachara. Her name was Patachara. Buddha

45:15.240 --> 45:20.160
gave dhamma. The same technique. And working on it, working on it, she came out of

45:20.160 --> 45:26.280
all her miseries. If Buddha had used some miraculous powers to give life to

45:26.280 --> 45:31.760
the son of Kisa Gautami. Or give life to the sons of this Patachara. Or the

45:31.760 --> 45:35.960
husband of Patachara. Or the mother, father, brother of Patachara. Then Buddha

45:35.960 --> 45:43.200
would not have been Buddha. Give dhamma. This is a temporary relief. Even if

45:43.200 --> 45:49.120
somebody gets life again. It's a temporary relief. Misery is there all the time. One

45:49.120 --> 45:53.880
starts understanding as one progresses on the path. A time comes. One can

45:53.880 --> 45:59.520
remember the past. Lives after lives. And Buddha says you just see. Lives after

45:59.520 --> 46:04.320
lives. Countless lives. How many of your relatives, your dear ones have passed

46:04.760 --> 46:09.600
away. They have died. If you just accumulate the bones of all those who

46:09.600 --> 46:14.680
have died in the past and you accumulate it will be like a huge mountain. And the

46:14.680 --> 46:19.840
tears that you have shed with every dear one who has died. If you accumulate all

46:19.840 --> 46:25.240
those tears it will be like a huge ocean. You want to carry on the same thing in

46:25.240 --> 46:29.920
future also. Life after life. Countless life in future. Again rolling in misery.

46:29.920 --> 46:36.280
Come out of it. Here is a way. Here is a technique. N of you, N of you have suffered so

46:36.280 --> 46:41.800
much. Come out of it now. Come out of it. And he gives this technique. Which is just

46:41.800 --> 46:47.000
law of nature. Everybody works on it. Whoever works comes out of it. And it is

46:47.000 --> 46:52.040
not necessary also that to work on this technique one must come out of the

46:52.040 --> 46:57.120
householder's life. One should become a monk or a nun. Well if one becomes a monk

46:57.120 --> 47:01.800
or a nun there are less responsibilities of the worldly life. And one can work,

47:01.800 --> 47:06.120
give full time to this. The work becomes easier. But this is not absolutely

47:06.120 --> 47:11.160
essential. Dhammaiswar is for everyone. A recluse, a monk, a nun or a householder.

47:11.160 --> 47:15.200
Householder may have difficulties because of so many responsibilities. But

47:15.200 --> 47:21.080
still the path is the same for both. Hardly there were hundred thousand monks or

47:21.080 --> 47:25.880
nuns with him. And rest of them, millions of them in northern India.

47:25.880 --> 47:29.920
Practicing vipashna and coming out of their misery. Practicing vipashna coming

47:29.920 --> 47:36.080
out of their misery. An incident of a very rich person. A multimillionaire of

47:36.080 --> 47:44.880
those days. Anath Pandika. He used to give lot of dana. Lot of dana. Because

47:44.880 --> 47:51.160
tradition is such that a householder must give dana. If one does not give

47:51.160 --> 47:59.800
dana then there is more of ego. As a householder one is not supposed to beg

47:59.800 --> 48:05.200
food from others. For a monk it is alright. For a nun it is alright. As a

48:05.200 --> 48:12.080
householder one has to earn money properly, honestly, hard-workingly. But

48:12.080 --> 48:19.160
when you start earning money then the madness comes. I am so smart. I am so

48:19.160 --> 48:24.520
intelligent and that is why I am earning so much money. This ego. One starts

48:24.520 --> 48:28.360
living a ego-centered life. A self-centered life and starts hating

48:28.360 --> 48:32.480
everybody else. Oh these people. Ignorant people. They are not intelligent. They are

48:32.480 --> 48:35.080
not smart. That's why they are not hard-working. That's why they are not

48:35.080 --> 48:39.680
earning. And I look I am so smart. I am so intelligent. I am so hard-working. This

48:39.680 --> 48:46.200
ego comes which is dangerous. The whole purpose of giving dana was to come out

48:46.200 --> 48:52.400
of the ego. And the same dana makes one ego-centered person. One has lost dhamma.

48:52.400 --> 48:57.240
One doesn't know what for I am giving dana. This person was giving a lot of

48:57.240 --> 49:03.600
dana. This title Anatha Pindaka. Anath means orphans. Those who are very poor.

49:03.600 --> 49:08.160
Pindaka. One who gives them food. That was his title because he was giving so

49:08.160 --> 49:13.360
much food to all hungry people. He had branches of his business throughout

49:13.360 --> 49:16.840
India and beyond India in different countries. And this was a rule that

49:16.840 --> 49:20.680
wherever his office or branch is there nobody should remain go hungry there.

49:20.680 --> 49:25.560
People should get food. But still he didn't know dhamma. Came in contact with

49:25.560 --> 49:30.440
Buddha. That means came in contact with dhamma. Got vipassana. Practicing

49:30.440 --> 49:34.720
practicing. Purified the mind. Purified the mind. Got the first dip of Nibbani

49:34.720 --> 49:41.640
stage. Changed person altogether. Now he was a changed person altogether. Now

49:41.640 --> 49:47.960
giving donation is not to build ego. It's to deflate ego. It's to dissolve ego.

49:47.960 --> 49:53.320
All this money that has come to me it is because of my past good karmas it has

49:53.320 --> 49:58.200
come to me. It must be used for the good of others. Of course as a householder I

49:58.200 --> 50:02.000
must make use of it for my own maintenance. For the maintenance of all

50:02.000 --> 50:05.600
those who are depending on me. But the rest of it must go for the good of

50:05.600 --> 50:13.040
others. For the good of others. And now he understands the good of others which

50:13.040 --> 50:18.360
is the real good of others. I give food to a hungry person. I must give. It's

50:18.360 --> 50:23.480
alright. But next day again this person is hungry. I give water to a thirsty

50:23.480 --> 50:27.920
person. After some time again he may become thirsty. I give some medicine to a

50:27.920 --> 50:32.440
sick person. He may get another disease or the same disease may come up again. I

50:33.200 --> 50:37.560
may give clothes to a naked person. After some time the clothes get worn, torn and

50:37.560 --> 50:42.280
again he's naked. I'm not taking out, I'm not helping people to come out of all

50:42.280 --> 50:47.360
their miseries if they get dhamma. If they get this wonderful technique of

50:47.360 --> 50:52.640
vipassana. Oh they come out of their misery. Total liberation from misery.

50:52.640 --> 50:57.280
Misery that they were encountering from life after life, life after life. They

50:57.280 --> 51:02.400
will come out of it. Dhamma should go to each and every suffering person. Besides

51:02.400 --> 51:06.240
all the time giving material dana, this dana is most important.

51:06.240 --> 51:15.200
sabba dhanam dhamma dhanam janati. The dana of dhamma is the highest dana. And he

51:15.200 --> 51:18.360
goes to Buddha. Buddha at that time was living in Rajgiri.

51:18.360 --> 51:25.360
Please respect to him and tell sir. Why not come to Savasthi? He was living in

51:25.360 --> 51:30.400
Savasthi which was the most populated city of India of those days. Most

51:30.400 --> 51:36.960
populated city. Large number of people are miserable. All miserable. Rich or

51:36.960 --> 51:42.040
poor. If you have a meditation center there so many people will get benefit.

51:42.040 --> 51:46.840
Sir please do something. Come there. Buddha smiled. So he understood that

51:46.840 --> 51:53.040
Buddha has agreed. He came back home looking for a center. A place where Buddha

51:53.040 --> 51:57.800
can start teaching dhamma to people. Meditation center should not be in the

51:57.800 --> 52:02.440
midst of the city with so much of noise and all. It should not be very far away

52:02.440 --> 52:07.480
where people cannot go. So looking for a proper place. Peaceful and yet not very

52:07.480 --> 52:13.640
far away from the city. He came across, came across a garden. A park. Very calm.

52:13.640 --> 52:18.920
Very quiet. Congenial for meditation. And he inquired who is the owner of this

52:18.920 --> 52:24.560
park. And he came to know that the prince, the son of the king is the owner.

52:24.560 --> 52:32.120
Prince Jetav. And he went to him. Sir I want to buy your park. And the prince

52:32.120 --> 52:36.400
became very angry. I am not here to sell my park. This is for my own amusement. I

52:36.400 --> 52:43.360
can't sell it. No sir I have to buy. Any price. Just to get rid of him. The prince

52:43.360 --> 52:48.160
says you know the price of this land. You have to spread gold sovereigns. The

52:48.160 --> 52:55.120
entire land. This is the price. The deal is done. I will spread sovereigns.

52:55.120 --> 52:59.560
Cart loads of sovereigns he is bringing and spreading. The prince says have you

52:59.560 --> 53:03.920
gone mad? No land can be that valuable. What are you doing? Are you a mad

53:03.920 --> 53:10.720
person? He says no I am not mad. This land is going to become so valuable. Buddha is

53:10.720 --> 53:15.520
going to come here and teach wonderful vipashana. And all my wealth is nothing

53:15.520 --> 53:20.640
compared to one person getting vipashana. Even one person comes out of

53:20.640 --> 53:24.760
the misery. My wealth is nothing compared to that. And I know not one person.

53:24.760 --> 53:29.680
Thousands upon thousands will get benefit. And immediately meditation center

53:29.680 --> 53:37.240
where 10,000 people can live, stay, meditate, learn dhamma. This volition to

53:37.240 --> 53:41.920
serve others. Dana was there even previously. Now the Dana is how more and

53:41.920 --> 53:46.880
more people will get benefited. Not to inflate his ego. To deflate his ego.

53:46.880 --> 53:54.440
Dissolve the ego. Just to serve others. This multimillionaire it so

53:54.440 --> 54:01.640
happened that due to some karmas of the past he became a pauper for a short

54:01.640 --> 54:09.560
period. He had no money. He is a pauper. And when he was a money person he will

54:09.560 --> 54:14.040
come to the center every day morning and evening to meditate. And as a

54:14.040 --> 54:18.200
householder he understands I should not go to the center empty handed. I must

54:18.200 --> 54:22.000
carry something for the meditators. And every time he comes he brings something

54:22.000 --> 54:27.720
for the meditators. Now he's a pauper. He's got nothing to bring. And then

54:27.720 --> 54:34.560
something comes in his mind. Behind his house he's got a small garden. And in

54:34.560 --> 54:38.240
that garden he has accumulated very good fertile soil from different parts of

54:38.240 --> 54:44.240
India. Now he takes two handful of that earth. Fertile earth. Comes to the center.

54:44.240 --> 54:50.200
Under a tree. At the root of the tree. May this tree grow. Under the shade of this

54:50.200 --> 54:56.840
tree. May someone get dhamma. May someone get meditation. Volition is there. Whether

54:56.840 --> 55:02.760
handful of earth or millions of rupees makes no difference. Volition. It is the

55:02.760 --> 55:06.160
volition that counts. After some time again he became multimillionaire.

55:06.160 --> 55:11.320
Started giving the donation in the same way. He understands dhamma now. That

55:11.320 --> 55:16.960
whatever I give the amount is a material. My volition. My dhamma volition for the

55:16.960 --> 55:22.400
good of others. For the benefit of others. Not expecting anything in return.

55:22.400 --> 55:30.000
When one does not know dhamma. Then one keeps on giving dana but inflating the

55:30.000 --> 55:38.160
ego. One builds a big hospital. A school. A college. But wants it to be named a

55:38.160 --> 55:44.000
Goinka hospital. A Goinka school. A Goinka college. And this name must be

55:44.000 --> 55:49.200
written in golden letters at the gate. Goinka school. Goinka college. Madness. One

55:49.200 --> 55:55.000
doesn't know what one is doing. The whole volition is wrong. Understanding of

55:55.000 --> 56:00.480
dhamma is wrong. The volition is to give without expecting anything in return. To

56:00.480 --> 56:04.680
give for the benefit of others. For the benefit of others. How people started

56:04.680 --> 56:14.600
changing. Changing in their life. Different people. Householders. One mother

56:14.600 --> 56:20.440
Visakhha. Again a daughter of a very rich person. Married to another rich person but

56:20.440 --> 56:27.240
the family had no dhamma at all. And how very wisely she turns the entire

56:27.240 --> 56:32.720
atmosphere of this family where there was no dhamma. How everybody became a good

56:32.720 --> 56:37.000
meditator and changed the whole attitude of the family. And the whole family

56:37.000 --> 56:42.320
became full of peace, harmony. Where there was so much of tension and misery. How

56:42.320 --> 56:48.720
dhamma starts working. Brings peace for one and all. And this was not merely at

56:48.720 --> 56:54.280
the time of Udthar. It kept on. Whoever worked. Whenever one worked the same

56:54.280 --> 57:01.960
result comes. One incident in the life of my teacher C.R.G. Ubakhine when

57:01.960 --> 57:09.720
Burma became independent. There were small small states, princely states. And a

57:09.720 --> 57:13.960
person, a good politician, statesman, he amalgamated all these states and made a

57:13.960 --> 57:19.360
union of Burma. And to satisfy these princes one of their leader was made the

57:19.360 --> 57:23.320
president of the country of the union of Burma. Now president has got no power

57:23.320 --> 57:27.000
according to the Constitution there. The prime minister has all the powers. And yet

57:27.000 --> 57:32.240
this person becomes so happy that I am now the president of the union of Burma.

57:32.240 --> 57:41.120
Previously I was just a ruler of a small small place. Very happy. One evening he

57:41.120 --> 57:45.960
gives a big party. All the diplomats and the elite of the of the city they all

57:45.960 --> 57:52.760
come there. A big party. 7.30 is the time to start the party. Everybody has come.

57:52.760 --> 57:57.960
All the guests have come. The host is not to be seen. 7.45 the host is not to be

57:57.960 --> 58:01.560
seen. 8 o'clock the host is not coming. Prime minister got worried. What's going

58:01.560 --> 58:06.840
on? He sent somebody to the residence in the first floor. And those who went up

58:06.840 --> 58:12.360
there came back and told him sir he can't come. Why? What happened? He has

58:12.360 --> 58:17.320
drank so much. He's unconscious lying on the floor. He can't come. Oh but without

58:17.320 --> 58:20.560
the host how can this party this is president's party. Conscious or

58:20.560 --> 58:25.880
unconscious? Bring him somehow. Let us start the party. And two of them helped

58:25.880 --> 58:29.800
him to come. Half conscious half unconscious hiccuping hiccuping and he

58:29.800 --> 58:35.120
comes. He's made to sit on the main chair and the course and the dinner starts.

58:35.160 --> 58:40.280
First course is served. Second course is served. When the third course was being

58:40.280 --> 58:45.640
served he started vomiting. Vomiting. Prime minister was so unhappy. We call

58:45.640 --> 58:49.880
our land a Dhamma land. Our government a Dhamma government. And what sort of

58:49.880 --> 58:54.680
president we have got? What could be done? Next day when he came to census he

58:54.680 --> 58:59.120
telephoned to prime minister. If you want I will resign. But I cannot come out of

58:59.960 --> 59:05.680
alcohol. It is impossible. In our royal tradition when the heir to the throne is

59:05.680 --> 59:09.840
born that means the first son to the king is born then the first input given

59:09.840 --> 59:15.520
is the best quality alcohol. In a silver spoon or a gold spoon. This was my first

59:15.520 --> 59:20.600
input sir. And since then I'm taking alcohol alcohol. Half of my blood has

59:20.600 --> 59:26.680
become alcohol. I can't come out can't come out of alcohol. Now this person

59:26.680 --> 59:31.760
fortunate because of some good parmi of the past. One day he passes in front of

59:31.760 --> 59:36.800
the teachers. Just out of inquisitiveness enters there. And

59:36.800 --> 59:40.880
that was the day the tenth day the last day and he sees everybody's face blooming

59:40.880 --> 59:46.280
with operation is over now. And bomb is given on the wounds. Everybody smiling

59:46.280 --> 59:51.200
smiling. Hey what's going on here? Meditation is taught. What meditation?

59:51.200 --> 59:55.760
Anapana is taught. Vipassana is taught. Being a born Buddhist he has been reading

59:55.760 --> 59:59.120
about this Anapana and Vipassana in the scriptures but he never knew that

59:59.120 --> 01:00:02.920
anybody is teaching this and such results are coming. Everybody says we

01:00:02.920 --> 01:00:09.320
feel so peaceful so harmonious. I had no peace in my life. I never know what

01:00:09.320 --> 01:00:15.240
harmony is. I'm such an agitated person. Sir can I come can I come also join? Yes

01:00:15.240 --> 01:00:20.080
yes. Whether a prince or a pauper anybody everybody can come and meditate.

01:00:20.080 --> 01:00:26.360
What shall I have to do? You have to take five precepts. Five precepts? Oh no no no

01:00:26.360 --> 01:00:32.760
four precepts. Fifth one is out of question I can't do. Then go away we

01:00:32.760 --> 01:00:38.200
can't take you. And he wants this peace and he's not taken. So he starts arguing

01:00:38.200 --> 01:00:44.040
starts bargaining. One little peg sir every day very little. No nothing

01:00:44.040 --> 01:00:49.400
doing. One peg after alternative days nothing doing. One in five days nothing

01:00:49.400 --> 01:00:53.440
doing. Go away we can't teach you unless you have got this foundation strong. This

01:00:53.440 --> 01:00:58.400
five sila are foundation of meditation. And then he says all right then somehow

01:00:58.400 --> 01:01:04.440
I will control myself but sir under one condition that when I go back home you

01:01:04.440 --> 01:01:08.000
should not stop me from drinking. How can I stop you going back home? You are your

01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:12.320
own master. You drink as much as you like. But here no I would recommend you

01:01:12.320 --> 01:01:15.960
going back home you should not drink. But if you drink how can I stop you? But

01:01:15.960 --> 01:01:21.600
these ten days no drink. All right sir I want peace. I want harmony. And he

01:01:21.600 --> 01:01:25.800
practiced the same practice. After ten days he goes to the president house his

01:01:25.800 --> 01:01:30.080
own house there. And somebody is drinking even hundred yards away. He says

01:01:30.080 --> 01:01:35.000
drinking. Who is drinking here? He can't bear. He can't bear others drinking out of

01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:40.000
question for him to drink. And the whole ten days nobody told him if you go back

01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:44.320
home and drink you will get this hell or that hell nothing doing. In Dhamma there

01:01:44.320 --> 01:01:50.520
is no threatening. What happens? What is drink? He is addicted to the sensation of

01:01:50.520 --> 01:01:53.760
the drink. And when he learned how to observe the sensation observe the

01:01:53.760 --> 01:01:57.640
sensation all the sankharas of the alcohol had gone away. The addiction of

01:01:57.640 --> 01:02:02.920
alcohol was gone away. How can he drink now? If this has happened only to one

01:02:02.920 --> 01:02:07.080
president of the Union of Burma perhaps there was some miracle involved. This

01:02:07.080 --> 01:02:12.120
happens to thousands of people coming to courses. Addict to alcohol. Addict to

01:02:12.120 --> 01:02:17.320
drug. Addict to this or more than that. Addict to craving. Addict to aversion.

01:02:17.320 --> 01:02:23.520
Addict to fear. Addict to depression. All these mental illnesses how they go away

01:02:23.520 --> 01:02:30.280
easily. Dhamma is so wonderful. Dhamma is so scientific. Dhamma is so non-sectarian.

01:02:30.280 --> 01:02:35.680
Dhamma is so universal. Dhamma is so result oriented. It gives you result here and

01:02:35.680 --> 01:02:41.240
now in this very life. Good that you have joined the course. Make best use of the

01:02:41.240 --> 01:02:45.200
remaining four days. They are wonderful days of your life. At least get

01:02:45.200 --> 01:02:49.640
established in the technique. How to practice it? It's a lifetime job. You have

01:02:49.640 --> 01:02:53.920
to work for the whole life but get established in the technique. Make use of

01:02:53.920 --> 01:03:00.360
the time. Make use of the opportunity. Make use of the facility. Make use of this

01:03:00.360 --> 01:03:07.080
wonderful Dhamma. The wonderful technique. To come out of the bondage of all the

01:03:07.080 --> 01:03:19.680
cravings, aversions, illusions, delusions. To enjoy real peace, real harmony, real

01:03:19.680 --> 01:03:32.000
happiness. May all of you enjoy real peace, real harmony, real happiness.

01:04:37.080 --> 01:04:52.440
Hmm. Take rest for about five minutes and then again start working. Take rest for

01:04:52.440 --> 01:04:54.920
five minutes.

